  "description": "Light, lighter, Lyke. The LYKE CF SE is the lightest eBike in our line-up – and an absolute game changer. This light eMTB is incredibly agile and nimble, delivering top performance even on rough terrain. A key contributor is the unparalleled ePerformance of the compact Fazua Ride 60 drive system. It offers just the right amount of support on climbs while impressing with its ultra-light setup. The carbon frame with a closed down tube and the unique placement of the motor in the seat tube save even more weight, allowing for an innovative frame design with efficient kinematics. Exciting: our Special Edition is equipped with electronic RockShox Pike Ultimate Flight Attendant suspension, giving you a fully automatic setup. Trail biking has never been this light.",
